# Ledger-coverage declarations (#9922 F-087).
#
# The coverage census (`ledger_compare.py --coverage`, `make harness-coverage`)
# requires every Makefile --gate recipe to have >= 1 PASS/FAIL row in the
# tracked ledger, or a line HERE with a reason. VOID-only counts as unreached.
# A declared gate that gains a measured row fails the census (shrink-only:
# remove the line). Same contract shape as HARNESSES.unreached.
#
# Every line below is the same fact, stated per gate so each one is removable
# independently: ZERO rows in test/results/ledger.d at #9922 filing time. The
# tail of each line names what a recorded run needs.
cc-rollback-arm-a no rows in the tracked ledger; needs a recorded run of the #1922 rollback gate arm A on the loss cluster
cc-rollback-arm-b no rows in the tracked ledger; needs a recorded run of the #1922 rollback gate arm B on the loss cluster
test-active-active no rows in the tracked ledger; needs a recorded per-RG failover run (cluster + iperf3 server)
test-chained-crash no rows in the tracked ledger; needs a recorded chained-crash run (cluster + iperf3 server)
test-connectivity no rows in the tracked ledger; needs a recorded run (read gate; F-158 lock-idle probe lands in #9922)
test-double-failover no rows in the tracked ledger; needs a recorded double-failover run (cluster + iperf3 server)
test-private-rg no rows in the tracked ledger; needs a recorded private-RG election run on the loss cluster
test-restart-connectivity no rows in the tracked ledger; needs a recorded daemon-restart run (cluster + iperf3 server)
test-stress-failover no rows in the tracked ledger; needs a recorded stress-failover run (cluster + iperf3 server)
test-wire-properties no rows in the tracked ledger; needs a recorded run (read gate, hermetic wrap)
wire_appmatch_twins no rows in the tracked ledger; needs a recorded run of the #9531 appmatch-twins gate on the loss cluster
wire_policy_deny no rows in the tracked ledger; needs a recorded run of the #9531 wire-deny gate on the loss cluster
wire_hostinbound_deny no rows in the tracked ledger; needs a recorded run of the #10029 host-inbound deny gate on the loss cluster
wire_conntrack_lifecycle no rows in the tracked ledger; needs a recorded run of the #10030 conntrack lifecycle gate on the loss cluster
